0..70 Comment "// A module\'s family names only the constructors it declares, and only"
71..112 Comment "// inside the module by their bare names."
113..115 Comment "//"
116..191 Comment "// A path through a module to a constructor the family lacks names nothing,"
192..255 Comment "// and neither does a bare constructor name outside the module."
256..258 Comment "//"
259..334 Comment "// The lowering refuses `M.Nope` as a member `M` lacks, and `M.Box.Nope` as"
335..411 Comment "// a member `Box` lacks. It refuses a bare `B` outside `M` as a name nothing"
412..421 Comment "// binds."
422..424 Comment "//"
